{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-24","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与中项无理线段与角","englishTitle":"The rectangle contained by medial straight lines commensurable in length is medial.","book":10,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","contentId":"euclid-10-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1260237089b235f7ab9882cf7eb05afb3455a7e20db425817dcb1a17f3559edc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-24.statement","euclid-10-24.construction.1","euclid-10-24.proof.1","euclid-10-24.proof.2","euclid-10-24.conclusion","euclid-10-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"410aa0d1cae994630e5735d321755fe5f09570c1e28d1695a36d2009f0220220","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The rectangle contained by medial straight lines commensurable in length is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形由中项无理线段 长度可公度组成,中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4251da1982ef79b8a704899985273cd608943451e118ecd64091375d36c10c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the rectangle AC be contained by the medial straight lines AB, BC which are commensurable in length; I say that AC is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由中项无理线段 AB,BC(即长度可公度)组成矩形 AC;我说AC是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48815fe8202a7deb4f6e43fca17120878cb49f93d1d76d1347697773122ddf58","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on AB let the square AD be described; therefore AD is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,请说明正方形 AD,因此AD是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"057617ac30cef2e6d90fbceed0d4aeae052e238d4293b56487fcb128bdaaa131","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is commensurable in length with BC, while AB is equal to BD, therefore DB is also commensurable in length with BC; so that DA is also commensurable with AC. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是长度可公度,BC,AB等于BD,DB也是长度可公度,BC,DA也是可公度,AC [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ecc854fd79d3fd3226a60a9163e1baafc76a4fbf6d676d1867ae82f085ede125","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DA is medial; therefore AC is also medial. [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DA是中项无理线段,AC也是中项无理线段,Q,E。 [[X. 23, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-23)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-24.source","contentId":"euclid-10-24","revisionId":"euclid-10-24@raw-1260237089b235f7","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01dcf8dba4f61553dddbdf169f3857ca7181117357fb1e4349372ad3da32df96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-24:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.24/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-24:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-24.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:ct